      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2026-08-21"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Ghalta the Unstoppable's cost reduction ability can't reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {G}."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2026-08-21"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """The first step of casting a spell is to move it to the stack. If this causes the greatest power of creatures you control to change (perhaps because you control a creature whose power is determined by the number of cards in your hand), that new power will be used to determine the cost reduction."""@en ] ,
