        :rulingText """Ghalta the Unstoppable's mana value doesn't change no matter what the greatest power of creatures you control is."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2026-08-21"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Once you determine the cost to cast Ghalta the Unstoppable, you may activate mana abilities to pay that cost. If the greatest power of creatures you control changes while activating mana abilities, the cost to cast Ghalta remains what you previously determined."""@en ] .

